<title>JAPAN: Japan Feb domestic WPI falls 0.2 pct yr/yr - BOJ.</title>
<headline>Japan Feb domestic WPI falls 0.2 pct yr/yr - BOJ.</headline>
<dateline>TOKYO 1996-03-10</dateline>
<text>
<p>Japan's domestic wholesale price index, a key component of the overall WPI, was down 0.2 percent in February from a year earlier but up 0.1 percent from the previous month, the Bank of Japan (BOJ) said on Monday.</p>
<p>The following is a breakdown of the February WPI:</p>
<p>Year-on-year change (percent)</p>
<p>	    February     January</p>
<p> Overall   +1.6	  +1.0</p>
<p> Domestic  -0.2	  -0.3</p>
<p> Exports   +5.5	  +2.8</p>
<p> Imports  +16.5	 +13.1</p>
<p>Month-on-month change (percent, index base year 1990):</p>
<p>	    February     January   Feb Index</p>
<p> Overall   +0.6	  +0.3	 94.3</p>
<p> Domestic  +0.1	  -0.1	 95.3</p>
<p> Exports   +2.5	  +1.3	 89.7</p>
<p> Imports   +3.4	  +3.4	 90.9</p>
</text>
